OL,3,ATrial of US mother accused of murdering
OL,4,Aher children hearing closing arguments
OL,5,
OL,6,FClosing arguments are under way in the
OL,7,Ftrial of Lindsay Clancy, an American
OL,8,Fmother accused of murdering her three
OL,9,Fchildren in Massachusetts in 2023 - she
OL,10,Fin flanked by her lawyer in the
OL,11,Fcourtroom
OL,13,FClancy, 36, is charged with three
OL,14,Fcounts of first-degree murder over the
OL,15,Fdeaths of Cora, five, Dawson, three,
OL,16,Fand eight-month-old Callan - here's
OL,17,Fwhat you need to know
OL,19,FProsecutors allege the former labour
OL,20,Fand delivery nurse intentionally
OL,21,Fstrangled and killed her children
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
